  "articleBody": "Start detached ADU construction by confirming the property’s jurisdiction and buildable area, then define the unit’s purpose, survey existing conditions, develop a code-conscious design, coordinate utilities and site access, submit a complete permit package, and compare construction proposals by scope rather than headline price. Keep decisions documented before work begins.",
